---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="StrapSheets" description="Strap sheets for drilling tools, filled in on the phone and emailed as a PDF.">
  <h1>Strap sheets, on the phone.</h1>
  <p>StrapSheets walks a tool measurement the same way the shop sheet does, draws the card, and hands a PDF to the mail app already on the phone. There is no account. The sheet stays on the device until you send it.</p>
  <p class="badges">
    <span class="badge">App Store listing coming</span>
    <span class="badge">Google Play listing coming</span>
  </p>
  <p>Free includes every standard tool and a banner ad on the session list. Pro removes the ad and unlocks the Custom tool builder and thread names you add yourself.</p>
</Base>
